'''Archer''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 365
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Archer
|name2 = Archer CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Archer CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Archer at his core is a run-of-the-mill super-backliner, meaning his ease of use is quite high. He has a very high range reaching 800 with 4K DPS, which is pretty solid! However please note his massive blindspot may leave him vulnerable to enemy attacks, possibly even being interrupted during his animation. Similar to the [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|two]] [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'artanyans]], his wave immunity allows him to snipe ranged [[:Category:Wave Attack Enemies|Wave Attackers]] (one of the most notable cases being [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)|Hermit Cat]] at [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30]]).

{{Job|Classification = Sniper}}

